WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:09.813
Are you worried about the time drafting takes. Do you want quick drafting based on rules and procedure? Well, LawFilings is here for you.

2
00:00:09.813 --> 00:00:19.500
Here you get real assembled drafts which you can print or download as PDF or Word files. Not mere blank brackets left for you to fill in.

3
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:28.594
The drafting wizards of LawFilings are built on real procedure, with proper checks of deadlines, jurisdiction and eligibility right at the start.

4
00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:34.010
It covers all district courts, High Courts, the Supreme Court and tribunals.

5
00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:40.417
Here, along with filing, you can also track your cases and add status updates over time.

6
00:00:40.417 --> 00:00:47.875
You also find over three hundred Acts and the Constitution, sourced from primary text and curated for litigation.

7
00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:53.500
So how does it work? A simple four step process, not a blank page.

8
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:59.406
Step one, answer plain questions, in simple words or precise legal phrasing.

9
00:00:59.406 --> 00:01:10.646
Step two, upload a PDF of what you have, like an FIR, a notice, an order or a complaint. We fill in whatever details we can, straight from the PDF.

10
00:01:10.646 --> 00:01:17.104
Step three, before you fill in any details, we catch deadlines and gaps, not after.

11
00:01:17.104 --> 00:01:24.010
Step four, you get an assembled draft, ready to print or download as a PDF or Word document.

12
00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:30.583
So, what are you waiting for? Start your drafting on LawFilings and see the difference.
